## Legal text

### Article 84 – Regulatory status of products

Upon a duly substantiated request of a Member State or on its own initiative, the Commission may adopt implementing acts, determining whether or not a specific item, or category of items is a product within the meaning of [this Regulation](/lagstiftning/cpr).

Those implementing acts shall be adopted in accordance with the examination procedure referred to in Article [90](/lagstiftning/cpr/kap-15#article-90-committee-procedure)(3).
<!-- scan-laws:end -->

